{"ID":"20240118151248-1p2zcy8","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151248-1p2zcy8","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151248-1p2zcy8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151248-n5y4ir2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122110037-jjs5wnk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122110037-nme24if\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:425,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:425\u0026#125;","title":"104蔓荆实","type":"doc","updated":"20240130093856"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151248-n5y4ir2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151248-n5y4ir2","updated":"20240122110015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦微寒，主筋骨间寒热痹，拘挛明目，坚齿利九窍，去白虫，久服轻身耐老。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110018-afoq5rh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110018-afoq5rh"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产我国河南甘肃江浙等地，子入药。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110023-cs0625b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110023-cs0625b"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦辛，性微寒，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110024-4mp9o2r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110024-4mp9o2r"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】蔓荆子为搜风凉血要药，主利九窍，散风邪，明目坚齿，治风头痛脑鸣，湿痹拘挛。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110026-uofkbi6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110026-uofkbi6"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】风头痛脑鸣，目泪出，益气，令人光泽，脂致。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110027-984hg2q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110027-984hg2q"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】治贼风，长髭发。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110029-q5zb81w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110029-q5zb81w"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】利关节，治痫疾，赤目。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110030-mru3gke","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110030-mru3gke"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【元素】太阳头痛头沉昏闷，除昏闷，散风邪，凉诸经血，止目精内痛。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110031-dopgtml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110031-dopgtml"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【好古】搜肝风。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110033-9u6l2v9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110033-9u6l2v9"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通八分至二钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110035-ipyq901","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110035-ipyq901"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】头目痛不因风邪而由血虚有火者忌，胃虚人不可服，恐生痰疾。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110036-xtii2vo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110036-xtii2vo"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【容川】蔓荆子气烈，味辛而气发散，而质轻，故主散头目之风。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110037-ca9wop9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110037-ca9wop9"}},{"ID":"20240122110037-nme24if","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110037-nme24if","updated":"20240130093856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个104，蔓荆实也就是蔓荆子嘛，主要的也是搜风凉血。中药很多药你在看《神农本草经》的时候会发现：老师，它很多治疗的功能都是重复的。重复的原因是因为他的性味不一样，你看蔓荆实，它味苦辛，苦味，辛味，还微寒，它是搜风凉血的药，如果人没有风，或血很热，你不要去开那个蔓荆子，它是趋微寒。能够利九窍，通利全身的关节。那蔓荆实啊，还有很多松节啊很多东西，诸位呢，有个概念就好，真正我们经方在用的时候我们不是这样用的哈，真在经方在用的时候，有个概念。如果你少掉那位药，你说：“哎。。。这个你可以把蔓荆实拿进来。”现场没有这个药，药房没有，你可以拿这个药取代它。但是唐容川的讲得最好，蔓荆实的这个气非常的烈，气烈的意思就是说你闻这个味道很强，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"味辛而气发散"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，质非常的轻，质轻的药呢通通入头部，所以散头部的痛，头部的风，头痛啊头风啊这种我们可以用蔓荆子，这个跟他们有一点区分开来，比如我们入关节的药用关节的药，头痛的药我们用蔓荆实，当然我们有很多的药都治疗头痛，蔓荆子是一个。"}]},{"ID":"20240122110037-jjs5wnk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110037-jjs5wnk"}}]}